### 1.9 Required Hostname Resolution

Before generating ignition files, verify that the installation host can resolve the important OKD names.

Run:

```bash
getent hosts api.okd.ocp.lab
getent hosts api-int.okd.ocp.lab
getent hosts console-openshift-console.apps.okd.ocp.lab
```

You can also use:

```bash
nslookup api.okd.ocp.lab
nslookup console-openshift-console.apps.okd.ocp.lab
```

#### Expected result

The names should resolve to the expected OCI Load Balancer address where applicable.

Do not proceed if required DNS records return:

```text
NXDOMAIN
```

or resolve to an unexpected address.

