### 1.10 Prerequisite Verification Summary

Before proceeding to the OKD version selection, verify the following:

```text
[ ] OCI Compute instances are RUNNING
[ ] OCI Load Balancer is ACTIVE
[ ] Bastion SSH access works
[ ] Bastion can reach private nodes
[ ] Required node ports are reachable
[ ] Private nodes have outbound connectivity
[ ] API DNS resolves correctly
[ ] Internal API DNS resolves correctly
[ ] Application DNS resolves correctly
[ ] SSH key pair is available
[ ] OKD pull secret is available
[ ] openshift-install is available
[ ] oc CLI is available
[ ] Installation directory is ready
[ ] Hostname resolution works
```

Only after these prerequisites have been successfully verified should the installation proceed.

